# Dark Samus projectile reflect and dive hit: Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2
# (MP2_WORLD="1baa96c2,10_cliff_rooftop" MP2_INPUT="LAYER2@400"), boss u04f7. After a dive lands
# (the attack sent) the dive state sends back player shots near the boss's root bone, so beam
# shots are fired at the boss from 2 units through each landing (more than five in all, so the
# oldest kept uid is dropped); the dive lands on the player (the hit), unmorphed in the first two
# passes and morphed (X) in the third.
